-- G7 (mobile offline foundation) — FORCE RLS mobile sync tables (H2 variant)
--
-- This is the H2/local-profile variant of V20260812_3. The PostgreSQL
-- original lives under db/vendor/postgresql/ and applies FORCE ROW LEVEL
-- SECURITY to the four mobile sync tables. H2 does not support RLS at
-- all (the local/H2 profile runs with snad.rls.enabled=false in
-- application-local.yml). This H2 variant is intentionally a no-op —
-- RLS is enforced only on PostgreSQL Direct, which remains the
-- authoritative RLS acceptance database.
--
-- No SQL statements are executed on H2. The migration exists solely to
-- preserve Flyway version-parity between the PostgreSQL and H2 vendor
-- paths so that flyway_schema_history records the same version sequence
-- in both runtimes.
SELECT 1;
